# Keep installed deps and build junk OUT of the build context so `COPY server`,
# `COPY client`, `COPY shared` bake only SOURCE into the image (and never clobber
# the node_modules that `npm install` just produced, nor bloat the image/context).
**/node_modules
node_modules
.git
.github
**/dist
**/build
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
.DS_Store
.founding
.claude
.gstack
